  "capturedFrom": "管理端 → 训练主题 → 主题详情 → 切到「场景单元管理」Tab（默认折叠态）",
  "note": "Tab 面板不是 URL 参数驱动：点 .fs-tab 后 location.href 不变，内容区被整体替换，所以必须用 steps 先点 Tab 再量。量的是**折叠态**（该 Tab 的默认渲染状态），因为本项目审计脚本 visual-audit.mjs 没有 steps 能力，无法在审计时点击展开；展开态的结构与配色另用 tmp 脚本按同一份 measured 逐项核对。选择器全部锚在 .fs-tabbar 之后的面板 div 上，避免匹配到页头同色系徽章（页头也有 bg-amber-50 的「正常」徽章）。",
  "steps": [
    {
      "click": ".fs-tab:nth-child(1)",
      "wait": 2000
    }
  ],
  "probes": [
    {
      "id": "list",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div",
      "props": ["width", "display"]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolbar",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(1)",
      "props": ["width", "height", "display"]
    },
    {
      "id": "count",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(1) > p",
      "props": ["fontSize", "fontWeight", "lineHeight", "color"]
    },
    {
      "id": "ai-add",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(1) > button",
      "props": ["height", "fontSize", "fontWeight", "lineHeight", "color", "background"]
    },
    {
      "id": "cards",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(2)",
      "props": ["width", "display"]
    },
    {
      "id": "card",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(2) > div",
      "props": ["width", "height", "radius", "background", "borderColor"]
    },
    {
      "id": "card-summary",
      "selector": ".fs-tabbar + div > div > div:nth-child(2) > div > button",
      "props": ["width", "height", "padding", "display"]
    },
    {
      "id": "card-main",
